<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/providesSupportFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The `from` Agent provides support for each `to` Artifact. The use of the `providesSupportFor` type is constrained to `SupportRelationship` classed relationships."@en .
